      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `embed_batch.py` that generates embeddings for a batch of texts using a concrete external provider, I will write Python code that imports the necessary library from the chosen provider and includes a function to generate embeddings. The provider I will use is Amazon Bedrock, which is identifiable by the import of the `bedrock` library and the use of the `bedrock.embeddings` function. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862784052,
